  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Project Initiation Plan aims to expand UNDP support to improve the resilience of Cambodia&#x2019;s health system as per the upcoming national heath strategy, in close liaison with the Ministry of Health, WHO and other key partners. It will support health-related procurement, and will assess capacity needs for resilient health systems.</narrative>
